      <title>德国零售商8月显卡销量：RX 9070 XT单款抵NVIDIA全系</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/chiptech/post/20260909/%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E9%9B%B6%E5%94%AE%E5%95%868%E6%9C%88%E6%98%BE%E5%8D%A1%E9%94%80%E9%87%8FRX-9070-XT%E5%8D%95%E6%AC%BE%E6%8A%B5NVIDIA%E5%85%A8%E7%B3%BB/</link>
